('d-eta-clock-reads-files-s661','decision','The Commons ETA clock computes from the committed files','The ETA clock (#3360, PR #3371, preview at #commons/data/eta) takes remaining work and both paces from the program-requirements headline series, SLOs, objectives and colleges from the live read, plus commons.json, the integrations registry and skill harvest days. It keeps the mock''s estimate rates, stall shares, factors and pasted spend, each sourced.',array['commons','cdc','eta-clock'],'proposed','SkyKnot (S661), on Sam''s approval of the mock (#3360)','SkyKnot (S661)',date '2026-11-15'),
('d-eta-chips-as-words-s661','decision','The ETA clock''s chips are the house''s underlined words','The approved mock drew bordered pills; the port draws them as underlined words, bold over a wash when on (the controls rule, 2026-10-09), with the CO Brand Basics palette kept as --eta tokens and dark values that hold 3:1. Going live (menu, Commons-tab strip) waits on Sam''s go.',array['commons','eta-clock','ui'],'proposed','SkyKnot (S661)','SkyKnot (S661)',date '2026-11-15')
